# Exercises Promotions against the compose stack (`make up`): Staff manage Coupons, and Checkout
# evaluates one. Run the requests top to bottom in the IntelliJ HTTP client; the token requests
# store tokens for the ones after them.

@promotions = http://localhost:8087
@gateway = http://localhost:8000
@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/ecomm/protocol/openid-connect/token

### Staff token
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-cli&username=staff@ecomm.local&password=staff

> {% client.global.set("staffToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Checkout's own token (client credentials; the secret is dev-only)
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=checkout&client_secret=checkout-dev-secret

> {% client.global.set("checkoutToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Customer token
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-cli&username=demo@ecomm.local&password=demo

> {% client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Every Coupon, the seeded WELCOME10 among them
GET {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### A fixed amount off, with a minimum spend; the code is stored upper-case
POST {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "spring25", "discount": {"type": "AMOUNT_OFF", "amountOff": {"amountMinor": 2500, "currency": "EUR"}},
 "minimumSubtotal": {"amountMinor": 10000, "currency": "EUR"},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true}

### The same code again, in any case: 409
POST {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "SPRING25", "discount": {"type": "PERCENT_OFF", "percentOff": 5},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true}

### A percentage past 100: 400
POST {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "TOOMUCH", "discount": {"type": "PERCENT_OFF", "percentOff": 150},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": true}

### Read it back, in any case
GET {{promotions}}/coupons/Spring25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Evaluate it as Checkout: 25.00 EUR off
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "spring25", "subtotal": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}

### Below its minimum: 422, reason belowMinimum
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "SPRING25", "subtotal": {"amountMinor": 9999, "currency": "EUR"}}

### In another currency: 422, reason currencyMismatch
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "SPRING25", "subtotal": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "USD"}}

### Switch it off: replace every field but the code
PUT {{promotions}}/coupons/SPRING25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"discount": {"type": "AMOUNT_OFF", "amountOff": {"amountMinor": 2500, "currency": "EUR"}},
 "minimumSubtotal": {"amountMinor": 10000, "currency": "EUR"},
 "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z", "active": false}

### Now 422, reason inactive
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "SPRING25", "subtotal": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}

### The seeded WELCOME10: 10% off, rounded down
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "WELCOME10", "subtotal": {"amountMinor": 1001, "currency": "EUR"}}

### An unknown code: 422, reason unknown
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "NO-SUCH-CODE", "subtotal": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}

### A Customer can't evaluate: 403
POST {{promotions}}/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "WELCOME10", "subtotal": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}

### Nor manage Coupons: 403
GET {{promotions}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Through the gateway, Staff reach Coupons
GET {{gateway}}/api/promotions/coupons/WELCOME10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### But evaluation is never routed: 404, whatever the token
POST {{gateway}}/api/promotions/discounts/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{checkoutToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "WELCOME10", "subtotal": {"amountMinor": 15980, "currency": "EUR"}}

### Delete it: 204, then 404
DELETE {{promotions}}/coupons/SPRING25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###
GET {{promotions}}/coupons/SPRING25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
